<title>USA: Dayton Q3 profits in line with expectations.</title>
<headline>Dayton Q3 profits in line with expectations.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dayton Hudson Corp said Thursday that its third quarter earnings remain in line with expectations, despite a drop in September same store sales.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite the sales shortfall during the month, third quarter profits for the company remain in line with expectations and Target's October sales performance is expected to return to a more typical level.&quot;</p>
<p>Earlier, Dayton reported September same store sales dropped 1.3 percent. September same store sales for the Target division rose  0.9 percent.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
